# Sibling dashboard mock

**Only if `../flynn-plugin-dashboard` exists.** Otherwise skip this rule.

That plugin’s Compose stack uses `mock/`, not this cluster. Changing `GET /cluster/stats`, `GET /cluster/jobs-stats`, `GET /apps/:id/jobs-stats`, or JSON on `host.HostResourceStats` / `host.ContainerStats` requires updating `../flynn-plugin-dashboard/mock` in the same work (`hostStatsAt` / `jobStatsAt` keys). See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
